# Complete selectable realization of eq:MC_energy_balance for distinct fluid
# and solid temperatures. This is a composition recipe: instantiate
# thermal_subsystem_energy.i.template once with @SUBSYSTEM@=fluid and once with
# @SUBSYSTEM@=solid, then instantiate fluid_solid_heat_exchange.i.template.
# Each named kernel block remains independent and may be omitted only when its
# corresponding manuscript physics is inactive.

# Required template expansions, in order:
#   1. thermal_subsystem_energy.i.template          (fluid properties/fields)
#   2. thermal_subsystem_energy.i.template          (solid properties/fields;
#      omit the three fluid-only surface-energy state-rate blocks)
#   3. fluid_solid_heat_exchange.i.template         (equal/opposite sources)
#
# Optional composable providers selected by the input deck:
#   phase_transformation_nonequilibrium.i.template  conversion transfer work
#   reaction_energy_onsager_coupling.i.template     reaction-energy allocation
#   pairwise_phase_interaction.i.template           drag/mechanical heating
#   electric_enthalpy_maxwell.i.template            global field-power closure
#   surface_energy_overall_momentum.i.template      shared surface state/gradient
#
# Invariants enforced by the stitched hierarchy:
#   q_F = h_FS(theta_S-theta_F), q_S = -q_F;
#   q_F + q_S = 0;
#   q_F/theta_F + q_S/theta_S >= 0 for h_FS >= 0 and positive temperatures;
#   current-volume sources are multiplied by solid_reference_J exactly once;
#   shared electric-potential-rate power is closed globally by Gauss' law and
#   is not duplicated in either thermal subsystem.
#
# Durable executable evidence:
#   energy_atomic.two_subsystem_energy_all_terms_mms_1d
#   energy_atomic.two_subsystem_energy_all_terms_jacobian_1d
#   inter_subsystem_heat_exchange.two_temperature_energy_exchange_mms_1d
#   inter_subsystem_heat_exchange.two_temperature_energy_exchange_mms_2d
#   inter_subsystem_heat_exchange.two_temperature_energy_exchange_mms_3d
#   inter_subsystem_heat_exchange.two_temperature_energy_exchange_jacobian_2d
#   inter_subsystem_heat_exchange.two_temperature_energy_all_terms_mms_1d
#   inter_subsystem_heat_exchange.two_temperature_energy_all_terms_mms_2d
#   inter_subsystem_heat_exchange.two_temperature_energy_all_terms_mms_3d
#   inter_subsystem_heat_exchange.two_temperature_energy_all_terms_jacobian_2d
#   inter_subsystem_heat_exchange.two_temperature_energy_all_terms_jacobian_3d
#
# The explicit P2+P0 EG activation-token realization is available in
# two_temperature_energy_hierarchy.i.template.
